<title>USA: IPO PRICING - Bioreliance in range at $15.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - Bioreliance in range at $15.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		   Bioreliance Corp</p>
<p>   Priced At					 $15</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	     $14 - $15</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			2,400,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter	  Morgan Stanley &amp; Co</p>
<p>NOTE: The estimated price range for the planned initial public offering was raised to $14-$15 per share from $12-$14.</p>
</text>
